  "known_manual_decisions": [
    "Minor-oxide inclusion for some standards (e.g. BHVO-2G, BCR-2G) reflects a legacy extraction decision (TiO2 retained; trace P2O5/MnO dropped) not captured in this manifest; those standards are therefore excluded from the executable fixture. The clean 7-element standards GSE-1G and GSD-1G reproduce their stored cation proportions exactly and verify the conversion.",
    "Fe is reported as FeO (total Fe); no Fe3+/Fe2+ split is applied.",
    "Oxygen is excluded at match time (structural_exclude = O, Br, I)."
  ]
